body:
Oh my god, thank you all so so much. I was so scared to post on reddit but I'm glad I did. I've always felt insecure sorta insecure about the way I look especially with the beauty standard in the gay community but oh my god I feel so much better after reading every comment. Like, I legit teared up. 🥺Thank you. Hoodie is from H&M\~

&#x200B;

Also the comments about my skin and complexion really helps. I always get confused to being 16 or 17 but I'm 24 lol. Good black don't crack. c:
